# Retrospectives Directory
#
# Per PRD Part 13: Retrospective Process
#
# This directory stores periodic retrospective analyses.
# Each retrospective creates a file:
#
#   retrospectives/
#     weekly-YYYY-WW.md           # Weekly retrospectives
#     monthly-YYYY-MM.md          # Monthly retrospectives
#     post-calibration-*.md       # After calibration projects
#
# Retrospective Schedule:
# - Weekly: Every Sunday (scheduled)
# - Threshold: After 10+ new outcomes
# - On-demand: "Analyze my recent work"
# - Post-calibration: After calibration projects complete
#
# Each retrospective contains:
# - Skill Performance analysis
# - Gaps Discovered
# - Verification Quality assessment
# - Context Effectiveness review
# - Pattern Recognition
# - Changes Made with rationale
# - Recommendations
